WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.787
The Aktion T4 Parallel.

00:00:02.737 --> 00:00:10.125
Nazi Germany's involuntary euthanasia program was bureaucratically framed as compassion for lives unworthy of life.

00:00:10.125 --> 00:00:16.825
The terrifying parallel with Canada's MAID is not in the uniforms worn, but in the bureaucratic logic.

00:00:16.825 --> 00:00:26.150
When disabled citizens request MAID because they cannot afford rent, the state is executing its most economically vulnerable under the guise of autonomy.
